# Opalescence's effect lasts only while it is on the battlefield (CR 611.3a). Under it Glorious Anthem is a 3/3 creature
# that pumps itself to 4/4; on turn 3 Bot2's Lightning Bolt deals it 3 damage, not lethal. Bot1 then disenchants
# Opalescence in the same main phase: the Anthem stops being a creature at once, and the damage marked on it means
# nothing to a noncreature (CR 704.5g looks at creatures): it stays on the battlefield, an enchantment again.

